# Suucha - Claude Code Sync Extension

A VS Code extension that synchronizes your Claude Code sessions across devices.

## Features

- Session synchronization across multiple devices
- Automatic session backup and restoration
- Cross-platform support (Windows, Linux, macOS)
- End-to-end encryption for your session data

## Requirements

- VS Code 1.60.0 or higher
- An active Claude Code account

## Extension Settings

This extension contributes the following settings:

- `suucha.syncInterval`: How often to sync sessions (in minutes)
- `suucha.maxBackups`: Maximum number of backup sessions to keep
- `suucha.encryptionEnabled`: Whether to enable encryption for session data

## Known Issues

- Initial sync may take longer on large session repositories
- Linux users may need to configure file permissions for session storage

## Release Notes

### 0.1.0

Initial release with basic session synchronization features.

## For the maintainers

When adding this extension to the VS Code marketplace, ensure the following:

1. Update the version in package.json
2. Update the README with any new features
3. Test on all supported platforms
4. Update the .vscodeignore file if needed
</function_results>

